<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 150 mln Sfr five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 150 mln Sfr five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    20.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p>							 EOS	   06.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
